        "@value": "Added by the standard-license addition of 2026-09-15, which recorded the clause as a vocabulary gap. Applied to 1 license record by the standard-license addition of 2026-09-15."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Carried by NASA-1.3, whose recipient is asked to register and to report modifications."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#reciprocityScope",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "How far a share-alike condition reaches, as a short literal: the changed file,\nthe source form, the whole work, or the product the work is built into. It says in words what the\nattachment level of the cc:ShareAlike duty says in structure."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
