        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Added by the license library review of 2026-09-15, which recorded the clause as a vocabulary gap. Applied to 8 license records by the standard-license addition of 2026-09-15."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#sourcePublicationPeriod",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "How long the source code a license requires to be published must stay\navailable, and from when, as a short literal such as \"12 months from first deployment\"."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
